這就是為什麼我好難過，瑞秋 因為本來是他要求婚的

302
00:20:42,370 --> 00:20:43,730
What?!
什麼？

303
00:20:45,170 --> 00:20:46,900
You were gonna propose to me?
你本來要跟我求婚？

304
00:20:52,380 --> 00:20:53,780
No.
沒有

305
00:21:04,020 --> 00:21:05,750
Well, this is awkward.
喔，這真是尷尬

306
00:21:07,890 --> 00:21:13,730
But I was going to see if, you know, maybe you wanted to start dating again.
但是我本來是要問你 是否願意再重新開始約會

307
00:21:13,900 --> 00:21:19,770
- But that, I mean, that was all, Rach. - Dude, step up. I proposed.
-但是，我是說，只不過是這樣，瑞秋 -老兄，加點油吧，我都求婚了

308
00:21:19,940 --> 00:21:21,740
No, you didn't.
不，你沒有

309
00:21:21,910 --> 00:21:27,440
That's right. There's a lot going on here, and I think I ate some bad fruit earlier.
沒錯，發生太多事了 我想我一定是吃了什麼壞掉的水果

310
00:21:29,520 --> 00:21:32,140
All right, so let me just get this clear.
好了，讓我把事情搞清楚

311
00:21:32,320 --> 00:21:34,750
You didn't propose.
你沒有求婚

312
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:37,220
You weren't gonna propose.
你也沒有要求婚

313
00:21:38,490 --> 00:21:40,860
So this morning, I didn't have a boyfriend..
所以今天早上，我沒有男朋友…

314
00:21:41,030 --> 00:21:44,620
and somehow I got dumped twice today.
然而卻被拋棄了兩次

315
00:21:46,630 --> 00:21:52,300
Hey, she just woke up. She's hungry. Why don't we give this another try?
嘿，她剛醒來，而且餓了 我們再來試試看吧

316
00:21:53,210 --> 00:21:55,640
Here we go again.
好戲又來啦

317
00:21:56,540 --> 00:21:59,010
I can't believe you told her I was gonna propose.
我不敢相信你竟然告訴她我要求婚

318
00:21:59,180 --> 00:22:02,980
- I can't believe you're not gonna. - Hey, I am not gonna rush into anything.
-我不敢相信你並沒有要求婚 -嘿，我不想要急著做什麼

319
00:22:03,180 --> 00:22:05,210
Yeah, dude, I totally understand.
是啊，老兄，我完全可以理解

320
00:22:05,390 --> 00:22:08,840
Usually after I have a baby with a woman, I like to slow things down!
通常在我跟一個女人生了小孩之後 我也會想要放慢腳步的

321
00:22:10,220 --> 00:22:11,620
- Oh, my God! - What?
-喔，天啊！ -怎樣？

322
00:22:11,860 --> 00:22:13,550
She's doing it! She's breast-feeding!
她在吸了！ 她在吸奶了！

323
00:22:14,260 --> 00:22:17,090
It's beautiful.
真是太美妙了

324
00:22:17,300 --> 00:22:19,790
- I'll come back for her later. - Thank you.
-我等一下再回來 -謝謝

325
00:22:20,500 --> 00:22:26,410
- Wow, this feels weird. - What, good weird?
-哇，感覺真奇怪 -怎樣，是好的奇怪嗎？

326
00:22:26,610 --> 00:22:28,630
Wonderful weird.
棒透了的奇怪

327
00:22:29,940 --> 00:22:32,810
You know what, you guys? I'm gonna go too.
你們知道嗎？我也要走了

328
00:22:33,010 --> 00:22:37,250
And I'm sorry about everything.
我很抱歉

329
00:22:37,450 --> 00:22:41,290
- Honey, don't worry, it was my mistake. - No, Rach, I should've told you sooner.
-親愛的，別擔心，是我的錯 -不，瑞秋，我應該早點告訴你的

330
00:22:41,460 --> 00:22:43,150
It's just that..
只不過…

331
00:22:43,320 --> 00:22:45,220
Man, that kid is going to town!
天啊，這小孩真是厲害啊！

332
00:23:00,170 --> 00:23:02,330
She's perfect.
她真是完美

333
00:23:02,540 --> 00:23:04,770
We're so lucky.
我們真幸運

334
00:23:04,980 --> 00:23:07,110
We really are.
我們真的很幸運

335
00:23:11,420 --> 00:23:16,620
Look, I know it's not a proposal, and I don't know where you are..
聽著，我知道這不是求婚 而且我也不知道你的意思如何…

336
00:23:16,790 --> 00:23:20,690
but with everything that's been going on and with Emma, I'm..
但是有了艾□之後 一切的事，我…

337
00:23:20,860 --> 00:23:24,800
- I've been feeling.. - Yeah, I know.
-我一直感到… -是的，我知道

338
00:23:24,970 --> 00:23:26,830
I've been feeling..
我一直感到…

339
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:28,830
- Yeah? - Yeah.
-是嗎？ -是啊

340
00:23:30,840 --> 00:23:33,810
Okay, well, that.. Wow, okay, well..
好的，那麼，那… 哇，好的，那麼…

341
00:23:33,970 --> 00:23:37,640
Then maybe at least we can talk about us again?
那麼或許我們可以再考慮在一起？

342
00:23:39,450 --> 00:23:41,970
Yeah. Maybe.
是啊，或許

343
00:23:42,150 --> 00:23:44,310
Well, good. Okay.
那，很好，好的

344
00:23:44,480 --> 00:23:48,280
I kind of think, you know, if we, if..
我有點想，你知道的 如果我們，如果…

345
00:23:51,090 --> 00:23:54,320
You're wearing the ring.
你手上戴著戒指

346
00:23:59,530 --> 00:24:01,090
What's that?
你說什麼？

347
00:24:03,670 --> 00:24:07,130
And you told Phoebe you were engaged.
你告訴菲比你訂婚了

348
00:24:09,810 --> 00:24:12,240
I'm sorry, what?
很抱歉，你說什麼？

349
00:24:14,010 --> 00:24:18,750
When you thought Joey proposed..
當你以為喬伊是在求婚…

350
00:24:19,050 --> 00:24:20,710
did you say yes?
你有答應嗎？

351
00:24:32,100 --> 00:24:37,700
Kids, I spoke to a doctor and picked up these pamphlets on how to get pregnant.
孩子們，我跟醫生談過 拿了這些懷孕須知的傳單給你們

352
00:24:38,770 --> 00:24:41,470
- Hey, Dad. - Hi.
-嗨，爸 -嗨

353
00:24:46,480 --> 00:24:51,080
Sorry to bother you again, but could you pass my pamphlets back?
很抱歉再打擾你們 但是可不可以把我的傳單遞出來呢？

354
00:24:54,120 --> 00:24:55,880
Thank you.
謝謝

355
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000
